<title>EGYPT: Gambian, Egyptian presidents meet in Cairo.</title>
<headline>Gambian, Egyptian presidents meet in Cairo.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gambian President Yahya Jammeh met Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak in Cairo on Monday.</p>
<p>They discussed West Africa and the conflict in the Great Lakes region of central Africa, officials said.</p>
<p>Jammeh arrived on Sunday for a four-day official visit.</p>
</text>
